# ---------------- Blood.events (Task 16 Part E) ----------------
# One blood spray: spawned where a victim was hit (`TK_Player.events` and the enemy sheets both
# `spawn Blood at me` in their hurt/damage blocks), so the spray appears at the body rather than
# following it around.
#
# Gated on `my spawnedFrom` — the scene's Blood actor is a template, and its sheet runs at scene
# start even while the actor is inactive. Only spawned copies get this flag.
#
# Particle side (the `blood` asset on the ParticleEffect child): a 16-particle radial burst,
# ~0.8 s life, red, gravity pulling the drops down. N particles per burst is an emitter setting,
# not something the event language has to count.

when me appears
  my spawnedFrom is "Blood"
  play particle "blood"
  wait 1 seconds
  destroy me
